Subject: [PATCH] Kotlin migration round 3: drop run_java.sh, fold policy tests
 into Gradle

Replace tests/run_java.sh + tests/java/PolicyTest.java with a Gradle unit
test at mfga-xposed/app/src/test/kotlin/com/mfga/xposed/PolicyTest.kt
(JUnit4 via testImplementation), carrying the same behavioural assertions
for GeckoFontPolicy / ReplacementGuard / TargetPlatform / BadgeSamplePolicy.

check.yml: drop the 'sh tests/run_java.sh' step; bump node 22 -> 24.
build-mfga-xposed.yml: run 'gradle test' instead of run_java.sh; drop the
stale tests/java and tests/run_java.sh trigger paths.

Docs/README updated to the new 'gradle test' command.

Delivered as a handoff patch because it edits .github/workflows/*, which
the CI app token cannot push.

